        "answer": {
          "short": "$-\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$",
          "worked": "The reference angle is $30^\\circ$. Cosine is negative in Quadrant II.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\cos150^\\circ&=-\\cos30^\\circ\\\\\\cos150^\\circ&=-\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
