          "worked": "The reference angle is $45^\\circ$. Sine is positive in Quadrant II.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sin135^\\circ&=\\sin45^\\circ\\\\\\sin135^\\circ&=\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
